        "# Data race\n",
        "\n",
        "A data race occurs when concurrent accesses to the same memory include a write and lack the synchronization needed to make those accesses safe. It can lead to unpredictable behavior.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-data-race)"
      ]
    }
